----- Original Message ----
From: Thomas Cort <tcort@gentoo.org>
To: gentoo-alpha@lists.gentoo.org
Sent: Friday, June 30, 2006 8:07:25 PM
Subject: [gentoo-alpha] Modular X going Stable

Greetings,

Donnie Berkholz (spyderous) is marking Modular X.Org 7.1 stable on
alpha this evening. If you run a monolithic version of X.Org (ie any
version below 7) on your alpha, then you might be interested in the
"Migrating to Modular X HOWTO". It is available at the following URL:
http://www.gentoo.org/proj/en/desktop/x/x11/modular-x-howto.xml

If you encounter any bugs, please make a report on http://bugs.gentoo.org

-Thomas



-- 
gentoo-alpha@gentoo.org mailing list



